{"id":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q014","title":"第14題","version":"5","batch":"115-1-med1","sourceSha256":"3fababcd96c16678e5025cfc8c0403228a6363f59b0460652c06ee9fd1615a62","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_6c3d667090188191a22860b2d0d26d36","sourceAnchor":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q014","shortHtml":"<div><p>既有題庫解析（作者未另標示）</p><div><div><div><div><div><p>中咽縮肌起自舌骨的大角與小角，再向後附著於咽縫。上咽縮肌起自翼突鉤等，下咽縮肌起自甲狀軟骨與環狀軟骨。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>","html":"<div><div><h2>第14題</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\"><b>原題答案：</b>B</p></div><div><div><div><h3>閱讀詳解</h3><p>中咽縮肌起自<strong>舌骨大角、小角及莖突舌骨韌帶下部</strong>，肌纖維向後呈扇形展開，止於咽後壁的咽縫，因此 B 是直接與舌骨附著相配的選項。</p><p>三層咽縮肌的前方起點由上往下，可依序連成「顱骨／下頜骨 → 舌骨 → 喉軟骨」。吞嚥時咽縮肌協調收縮，把食團向食道推進；莖突咽肌則屬縱行肌，主要提升咽與喉。</p></div><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:400px;--reviewed-image-ratio:0.6015037593984962\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/809875105f1e25adb289feb830c9372c734d39da7d0dc564e3c50d065cf311ca.png\" alt=\"咽縮肌外側觀\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"665\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/809875105f1e25adb289feb830c9372c734d39da7d0dc564e3c50d065cf311ca.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption><p>咽縮肌外側觀</p><p>圖中 Hyoid bone 是舌骨；Constrictor pharyngis medius（中咽縮肌）由其後方向咽壁展開。再向上看上咽縮肌、向下看起自喉軟骨的下咽縮肌，可把三層起點連起來。</p></figcaption></figure><div><h3>選項辨析</h3><dl><dt>A</dt><dd>上咽縮肌主要起自翼突內側板下部、翼下頜縫與下頜骨舌骨肌線後端等處；不是本題的舌骨附著肌。</dd><dt>B</dt><dd>中咽縮肌起點包括舌骨大、小角，正是本題所問。</dd><dt>C</dt><dd>下咽縮肌包含甲咽部與環咽部，分別主要起自甲狀軟骨斜線與環狀軟骨；附著的是喉軟骨。</dd><dt>D</dt><dd>莖突咽肌由顳骨莖突起始，走入咽壁；它是舌咽神經（CN IX）支配的代表性肌肉，而不是由舌骨起始。</dd></dl></div><div><h3>一起記：起點與神經</h3><div><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><div class=\"reviewed-table-scroll\"><table><thead><tr><th>肌肉</th><th>主要起點</th><th>動作／神經重點</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>上咽縮肌</td><td>翼突區、翼下頜縫、下頜骨</td><td>縮咽；主要由迷走神經經咽神經叢支配</td></tr><tr><td>中咽縮肌</td><td>舌骨大角、小角、莖突舌骨韌帶</td><td>縮咽；與舌骨配對</td></tr><tr><td>下咽縮肌</td><td>甲狀軟骨、環狀軟骨</td><td>縮咽；環咽部參與上食道括約肌</td></tr><tr><td>莖突咽肌</td><td>顳骨莖突</td><td>提升咽；舌咽神經 IX</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><details><summary>來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gray1030.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gray（1918）Plate 1030</a>：Henry Vandyke Carter；公有領域（PD-scan），原圖像素未修改</li><li><a href=\"https://www.meddean.luc.edu/lumen/meded/grossanatomy/dissector/muscles/mcon.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Loyola Gross Anatomy：Middle Constrictor</a>：舌骨與咽縫附著</li><li><a href=\"https://www.meddean.luc.edu/lumen/meded/grossanatomy/dissector/muscles/scon.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Loyola：Superior Constrictor</a>：上咽縮肌起點</li><li><a href=\"https://www.meddean.luc.edu/lumen/meded/grossanatomy/dissector/muscles/icon.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Loyola：Inferior Constrictor</a>：甲咽部、環咽部</li><li><a href=\"https://www.meddean.luc.edu/lumen/meded/grossanatomy/h_n/cn/cn1/cn9.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Loyola：Glossopharyngeal Nerve</a>：莖突咽肌的運動支配</li><li><a href=\"https://www.meddean.luc.edu/lumen/meded/grossanatomy/h_n/cn/cn1/cn10.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Loyola：Vagus Nerve</a>：咽縮肌的迷走神經支配</li></ul></details></div></div></div>","imageCount":1,"sourceAnswer":"原題答案：B"}